    course_description = '<p>Apex’s GE course offers a contemporary style of English Language Teaching using effective teaching methods and quality textbook and resources. The General English curriculum and assessments have been designed to provide learners with the English language skills necessary for their personal, study, business, and employment purposes. </p> <p>Learners will:</p> <p>Learners will be tested on arrival so that they can be placed in a class suitable for their English proficiency level. During the course the following assessment methods are used, including:</p> <p>Students receive continuous feedback from their teachers about their progress and regular written reports.</p> <p>1 – 50 weeks based on levels:</p> <p>Full-Time</p> <p>Blended Learning</p> <p>Tuition Fee: <strong>$290 per week*</strong></p> <p>Enrolment Fee: <strong>$250 **</strong></p> <p>Resources Fee: <strong>$50 </strong>(charged for enrolments less than 10 weeks)</p> <p>Each GE level book costs approximately AUD $85</p> <p>Students must purchase a copy of the coursebook, Cutting Edge, for their level.</p> <p>After completion of the placement test, students will be informed of their level.</p>',
    total_course_duration = '50 weeks',
    offshore_tuition_fee = '290',
